This submission contains a single LaTeX source file (main.tex) with embedded
bibliography and five PDF figure files in the figures/ subdirectory.

Compilation:
  pdflatex main.tex
  pdflatex main.tex

The bibliography is embedded directly in main.tex (no separate .bib file needed).

Files included:
  main.tex                           - Main LaTeX source (self-contained)
  figures/fig1_equity_vs_alpha.pdf   - Figure 1
  figures/fig2_relocation_by_income.pdf - Figure 2
  figures/fig3_regional_heterogeneity.pdf - Figure 3
  figures/fig4_policy_comparison.pdf - Figure 4
  figures/fig6_game_structure.pdf    - Figure 5 (game structure)

Required packages (all standard in TeX Live):
  amsmath, amssymb, amsthm, graphicx, booktabs, natbib, geometry,
  hyperref, xcolor, float, subcaption, setspace, mathptmx

Recommended TeX Live version: 2023 or 2025
